 class=\"service-card__content\"><h3 class=\"service-card__title\">Chci pronajímat</h3><p class=\"service-card__lead\">Připravím apartmán pro turisty a zajistím provoz, úklid i stabilní výnos.</p></div></a></div></section><section class=\"zig fears-sec\" aria-labelledby=\"sec-03\"><div class=\"wrap zig__grid\"><div class=\"zig__media\"><div class=\"fears-media__card\"><picture><source srcSet=\"/images/zuzana-abruzzo-more.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"/><img src=\"/images/zuzana-abruzzo-more.png\" alt=\"Bc. Zuzana Bajgerová in Abruzzo by the sea\" class=\"fears-media__img\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\"/></picture><div class=\"fears-media__overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"fears-media__top-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><span>Personal guarantee</span></div></div></div><div class=\"zig__text\"><div class=\"listings__badge\"><span class=\"listings__badge-dot\"></span><span>4 Key Questions · Safe Purchase</span></div><h2 id=\"sec-03\" class=\"home-h2\">Four questions on your mind<!-- --> <br class=\"hidden sm:inline\"/><em>right now</em></h2><p class=\"home-lead\">Let me answer them right away. Until they are resolved, no property matters yet.</p><ul class=\"fears\"><li class=\"fear\"><div class=\"fear__num-col\"><span class=\"fear__num\">0<!-- -->1</span></div><div class=\"fear__content\"><h3 class=\"fear__q\">“I don’t understand the language or Italian law.”</h3><p class=\"fear__a\">I guide you through the entire process in your language. I negotiate with Italian authorities and send you clear, understandable summaries.</p></div></li><li class=\"fear\"><div class=\"fear__num-col\"><span class=\"fear__num\">0<!-- -->2</span></div><div class=\"fear__content\"><h3 class=\"fear__q\">“I don’t know w