rní pobřeží od Silvi Marina po Alba Adriatica, v zádech národní park Gran Sasso.</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/lokality/gran-sasso-a-vnitrozemi\"><b>Gran Sasso a vnitrozemí</b> — <!-- -->Horské obce, kamenné domy v historických centrech a nejnižší ceny v regionu.</a></li></ul></div></div></section><div class=\"landscape-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 40\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M0,30 C90,14 170,34 280,24 C400,13 470,31 600,20 C740,8 820,30 960,19 C1060,11 1130,25 1200,17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></div><section class=\"test-sec\" aria-labelledby=\"sec-09\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"test-sec__head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Reference</p><h2 id=\"sec-09\" class=\"home-h2 test-sec__title\">Věřte lidem, kteří to <em>už mají za sebou</em></h2><p class=\"home-lead test-sec__lead\">Přečtěte si skutečné zkušenosti klientů, kteří si splnili sen o bydlení v Itálii.</p></div></div><div class=\"test-carousel\"><div class=\"test-carousel__track \"><article class=\"test-card\"><div class=\"test-card__video is-paused\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Přehrát video se zvukem\"><video src=\"/video/referencni-video.MOV\" autoPlay=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"auto\"></video><div class=\"test-card__play-btn\"><div class=\"test-card__play-icon \"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"></path></svg></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"test-card__sound-btn\" aria-label=\"Vypnout zvuk\" title=\"Vypnout zvuk\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M3 9v6h4l5 5V4L7 9H3zm13.5 3c0-1.77-1.02-3.29-2.5-4.03v8.05c1.48-.73 2.5-2.25 2.5-4.02zM14 3.23v2.06c2.89.86 5 3.54 5 6.71s-2.11 5.85-5 6.71v2.06c4.01-.91 7-4.49 7-8.77s-2.99-7.86-7-8.77z\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"test-card__footer\"><div class=\"test-card__google-badge\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24